  "title": "Coastal Financial Corporation Announces Second Quarter 2025 Results",
  "summary": "EVERETT, Wash., July 29, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Coastal Financial Corporation (Nasdaq: CCB) (the “Company”, \"Coastal\", \"we\", \"our\", or \"us\"), the holding company for Coastal Community Bank (the “Bank”), through which it operates a community-focused bank segment (\"community bank\") with an industry leading banking as a service (\"BaaS\") segment (\"CCBX\"), today reported unaudited financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2025, including net income of $11.0 million, or $0.71 per diluted commo",
